{"pageid":5045,"title":"Holy Grail","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Holy Grail</span>","revid":21821,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/56/Holy_Grail.png/revision/latest?cb=20260601200941\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"&quot;The most powerful grail - a relic of a legend&#39;\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/56/Holy_Grail.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260601200941\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Holy Grail.png\" data-image-key=\"Holy_Grail.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Holy_Grail.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">\"The most powerful grail - a relic of a legend'</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Holy Grail</b>-quest item.\n</p><p>To start the quest enter the furnace behind the <a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Fridman\" title=\"Bob Fridman\">Bob Fridman</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> store. In the furnace there's an enter to <a href=\"/wiki/King_Oakler%27s_Basement\" title=\"King Oakler&#39;s Basement\">King Oakler's Basement</a>.\n</p><p>The quest includes 9 stages:\n</p>\n<ol><li>The Grail Beckons</li>\n<li>Sir Birdivere The Wise</li>\n<li>Sir Wallahad the Pure</li>\n<li>Sir Vector</li>\n<li>Goblin Guard's Riddles</li>\n<li>Sir Goblin the Not-Quite-So Brave</li>\n<li>Sir Dancealot the Brave</li>\n<li>Sir Doors</li>\n<li>The Forgotten Grail</li></ol>\n<p>The Grail Beckons:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Talk to <a href=\"/wiki/King_Oakler\" title=\"King Oakler\">King Oakler</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>Sir Birdivere The Wise:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go to the beach</li>\n<li>Search the beach for <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sir Birdivere The Wise (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2lyX0JpcmRpdmVyZV9UaGVfV2lzZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Sir Birdivere The Wise</span>.</li></ul>\n<p>Sir Wallahad the Pure:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go to the Azure Fields.</li>\n<li>Search the island for <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sir Wallahad the Pure (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2lyX1dhbGxhaGFkX3RoZV9QdXJlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Sir Wallahad the Pure</span>.</li></ul>\n<p>Sir Vector:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go to the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a></li>\n<li>Find the Ancient Shrine.</li>\n<li>Climb the Spire.</li>\n<li>Find <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sir Vector (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2lyX1ZlY3Rvcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Sir Vector</span>.</li></ul>\n<p>...\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/29/Mannequin_Knight.png/revision/latest?cb=20260601203827\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Mannequin Knight\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/29/Mannequin_Knight.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260601203827\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"235\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Mannequin Knight.png\" data-image-key=\"Mannequin_Knight.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Mannequin_Knight.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Holy Grail can be unboxed. If you unbox it, model will change on mannequin knight.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903033557\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time us